# app: whatsapp
# Sending (DECISIONS.md D21): favourites in the config (New message on the list), Reply in a conversation, the compose screen
# with typing and Paste (the clipboard holds a game score), the confirmation sheet, and a send the script answers with "sent"
# (fixture ha.example.test): a toast and back to the conversation.
wait 1500
shot whatsapp-send-list
tap 270 178             # Anna - Group (3)
wait 900
tap 270 918             # Reply
wait 900
shot whatsapp-compose
expect-state chars=0
type See you at six
wait 600
tap 472 924             # Enter: a line feed
wait 300
tap 78 504              # Paste: "Somdoku 12:34, no mistakes"
wait 900
expect-state chars=41
shot whatsapp-compose-typed
tap 400 504             # Send: always a confirmation first
wait 900
shot whatsapp-confirm
tap 270 812             # Send in the sheet: the script answers ok
wait 1500
shot whatsapp-sent
